t":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-13T06:40:10Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-13T06:40:10Z"},"message":"fix(infra): retry base release metadata fetch (#4676)\n\nTransient GitHub API failures currently make the release-please initial\nbaseline check fail while fetching base metadata.\n\nRetry those requests up to three times while retaining the existing\nexemptions for permanent client, permission, and expected missing-file\nresponses.","tree":{"sha":"393970d696a3776e0a7dcc520dd78efcd432b447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/393970d696a3776e0a7dcc520dd78efcd432b447"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/87b9663ad1b3dc06ce732aac32f6fc06f2a428d7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVIhKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATUsQAKCzhK5wI0RTpizfW2lmEjre\nYdfYvUo77Z2R03yH/YwV8YfONDvHpRdLV1fXnznyCgU9ZUPZeT8ZjkY3G8vSovia\no2oe3sF0ROxjfXB7TKEenX8AlofRjGf5n+IuJgQS3lHS0MxJVKiVp5bBotXh/RlR\nlzxNPnYUTAhj10Z4x4fLX9DXnADik8/8ZkLjz3R3UN5hibyZP0sMSmyFDPZfX8UV\n26V+Inv9rn6cOtDO3GpXdKyB5rhzyhgXX2q3ewCGqH4nUpXwGWJgvWI/t0kXJpRd\nUMcr0GGP7XHY7humW3RVXHrUNIMZBPtXSrrPCYkhtikH7XyiI62THHEDoaLFHjXM\nUWXmNbygq0tW89EkJUxLHpSpXXr+jjQAhawVb9n/ZWHR8NM6bE750f63RYGVRYsN\nxHXEEJh9a92D17fTvhp8xU/ut5QRtNuLadbpsIGIkx498QjHilnhYWzkrfefWiSc\ntZKJaWwluGy8z7XtDWMdBTnkwJch7/MauYnxZq8MNXK4YiD4VvZZuSDlK5qgbNIH\nJ8b2W+a7Elg+PRMvP52dXUhken+U08mr8pxqmLjjXL4axjR/C8Q23Qu7c02vSS+Y\ng3tswtWCvb0vkmuOWVQIXILBdqKW7jvYxjKKIBH956nGXlmV9uevr7B5YGYUfV5u\nMewfFzVw1lCTIGkokS4g\n=kf/j\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 393970d696a3776e0a7dcc520dd78efcd432b447\nparent 12a9c9d6813a83e5eeff9feed0c4068d1fcc69c4\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783924810 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783924810 -0400\n\nfix(infra): retry base release metadata fetch (#4676)\n\nTransient GitHub API failures currently make the release-please initial\nbaseline check fail while fetching base metadata.\n\nRetry those requests up to three times while retaining the existing\nexemptions for permanent client, permission, and expected missing-file\nresponses.","verified_at":"2026-07-13T06:40:11Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/87b9663ad1b3dc06ce732aac32f6fc06f2a428d7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/87b9663ad1b3dc06ce732aac32f6fc06f2a428d7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/87b9663ad1b3dc06ce732aac32f6fc06f2a428d7/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"12a9c9d6813a83e5eeff9feed0c4068d1fcc69c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/12a9c9d6813a83e5eeff9feed0c4068d1fcc69c4","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/12a9c9d6813a83e5eeff9feed0c4068d1fcc69c4"}]},{"sha":"12a9c9d6813a83e5eeff9feed0c4068d1fcc69c4","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDEyYTljOWQ2ODEzYTgzZTVlZWZmOWZlZWQwYzQwNjhkMWZjYzY5YzQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Ankush Gola","email":"9536492+agola11@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-13T06:36:27Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-13T06:36:27Z"},"message":"fix(code): avoid repeated startup auto-update stalls (#4648)\n\nStartup auto-update retried the same cached target on every launch after\na failure, which could strand users before the TUI started. This adds a\nsame-version cooldown, skips opportunistic auto-update for `--resume`,\nand terminates updater process groups on timeout so stale children do\nnot hold locks.\n\nFocused unit coverage was added for the cooldown, resume gating, and\ntimeout cleanup paths.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/3e0e7320-f512-6d6a-5f53-e5c08d2f899c)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"294f9c14ae28b6d11312b9a1bd4a350eca07b12e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/294f9c14ae28b6d11312b9a1bd4a350eca07b12e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/12a9c9d6813a83e5eeff9feed0c4068d1fcc69c4","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVIdrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaXMQAFhX5FkqUWpwOwhChEmBCyYi\nkj7JJOaQaVpIKox5rU9gzv+S0AJ+o6VIkllTVZP5VsK7wP4Zm2irQkfAtWOsgBW+\nD6dJmMKljHFKo1MpRon4gmXyWXj5eSeiG33eDUPNM4x+SiuyQARKvgFwAP+nGuFn\neEItMxEoFYIDQ6kImatoHO7M02y5LOPJcEKalUcvxF/2P1JLWq/2efbSAYOwFHSo\n+HlidtNI09zdexQxN4jYR0EGHjtbJxJcvgmLUNoO0yuUqUXrZNfuen6QMq29yH7v\n1aJhx7kv+COj7YiCW5+DlBXNM8xzt95/GhIi1zJc8j/jj8VRmB7YDoX2hfYQkSQs\ntJgLNyCyDBhm/I2RzQnXvE4TrimdXyumLkuUg9QN+LF6V7A+3ns/IB5EOMn/nmVc\nv2Jd/0p+xCefFA5PzjLEWLoDVxVwyCH7KBIWy91lWVERLMLzH2hzqzsWXhUWlP6e\nKc2sOSSJ65JiK2XiKsr3Usw8Nboz405AESFSn4A2xXDamiffH/iZc6tqtNp+5Q1M\noqDxXnm952fDiKWOSWsINtyBDS8AuzLU6YUHrPkhHtdfvH0zn1JdJKvJ9Flt/yy2\na2SJyU9LHeRbultlhxeMwT0dUyKivMsYEtCxrF0aZt9WKKDo7bA92Es6HHDSVH89\nSVfHubOzXu/1YMODatbj\n=vnSO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 294f9c14ae28b6d11312b9a1bd4a350eca07b12e\nparent 3b1f4ee722914ac4878b8e5df59742cc763acba2\nauthor Ankush Gola <9536492+agola11@users.noreply.github.com> 1783924587 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783924587 -0400\n\nfix(code): avoid repeated startup auto-update stalls (#4648)\n\nStartup auto-update retried the same cached target on every launch after\na failure, which could strand users before the TUI started. This adds a\nsame-version cooldown, skips opportunistic auto-update for `--resume`,\nand terminates updater process groups on timeout so stale children do\nnot hold locks.\n\nFocused unit coverage was added for the cooldown, resume gating, and\ntimeout cleanup paths.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/3e0e7320-f512-6d6a-5f53-e5c08d2f899c)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-13T06:36:28Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/12a9c9d6813a83e5eeff9feed0c4068d1fcc69c4","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/12a9c9d6813a83e5eeff9feed0c4068d1fcc69c4","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/12a9c9d6813a83e5eeff9feed0c4068d1fcc69c4/comments","author":{"login":"agola11","id":9536492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MzY0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9536492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/agola11","html_url":"https://github.com/agola11","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agola11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agola11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agola11/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agola11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agola11/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agola11/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agola11/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agola11/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/agola11/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"3b1f4ee722914ac4878b8e5df59742cc763acba2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3b1f4ee722914ac4878b8e5df59742cc763acba2","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3b1f4ee722914ac4878b8e5df59742cc763acba2"}]},{"sha":"3b1f4ee722914ac4878b8e5df59742cc763acba2","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDNiMWY0ZWU3MjI5MTRhYzQ4NzhiOGU1ZGY1OTc0MmNjNzYzYWNiYTI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-13T06:32:32Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-13T06:32:32Z"},"message":"chore(repo): update issue template areas (#4674)\n\nThe standalone deployment CLI is no longer an issue-template area, while\nDeep Agents Code is presented to users as `dcode`. This updates all\nissue templates so reports and requests use the current area names.","tree":{"sha":"8435d22faa67c0ecc8f9cd8135ca4362032aa6d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/8435d22faa67c0ecc8f9cd8135ca4362032aa6d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/3b1f4ee722914ac4878b8e5df59742cc763acba2","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVIaACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGHYQAE+n/Dqz0hEWvWKE/4Qf+dBV\nukPw839hQWOYHOXCf5jAGitzeXbeXKYAmRDvE6Z2awUsUYK3/VLFQ6rSUaxmY/qe\nhazceReEbUC8t8LJ5CGcjnIYmmoL51i7OQjKBDSB6VDSSNtteMs+/EcDrvLku7Aa\njH3IIi3K8ayan6+M2nHdAfoqzU1ejBCPq8drir8D26t6I+ejJoKQ80NCw9dreUYh\njSaCOAM8H9W1XK46B0AS9o4zxCClSZdYnKibnW80jXYU3Cg1F6Dqt7HL+Up6gxEj\nQRFwoKzYJFcQ4ruEPzWxEQvEuBVI9lWBpsoGnvIur9FXmoGmTkgNSdVb4