":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUXAACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjpEQAKvD1m6CgfpsA/IpzpendQjo\nZiF7t6FXn+G4U8NVfi4m1To+qRxWpWZLgP1EPjL+NPfJXlw6z5KNtdht1iUCUW+8\nDRYjC/0b3UfvClpD0NDhiNVq8iDPla/oeSWMszULLhQXqAgAZNIUupeQMYc91qW7\nkxuc7rfYnGMNdceW0zajiEBfveVQkRHsFW1Netfi+udnsVH8F2rOF+npmeWwA2EV\nlDeKEI2C3i7PUjvLe5fn1ASjoer0LaG7E34z9PgryOvG+ynxSQ0yA3ap00nH28Tu\ng1nHI4Qa4jf6Y3hpddEog9GkyN1GconANq2UfSbMiffnHFabmWE034a4E48m3gGD\nTHlq43pQEgmiI0Fn3//aMmh989Iz7C4sNf9Vv3ULVXrRU1O1k+1BdCWaUkptdsaV\ne1TZTGinX33a5mpFEdN+5gNs5cxNEYUkSvPUMkQIhkRH7jefnwSMjtUNxQKHGTjK\nrZLOIdJaJAfj7CLMLMl0HFMX8FYj6zsVlmz+HpT4FSWt6aAAlhmHyDXOj0HHEEjY\nNdis1DOIJM94lNgnpMx5DkxqXTiwK7LCOu8F00zt6t5Bz7HvfJ6ZE6sxtzdorNkx\nk+AKzaOVokZOoz8kLpaAZs2to0Rh5cKh2JjL/HI2G6RBGB2ZSdIy8b+BVQ596re5\nnj3WXg9sCAYz/oaF2lfb\n=EFVD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ae7d4495304f5697c5bbad67614ea76d3767c144\nparent ad7453d4dfd3e47a26df400b5c4b3f7ff34a86be\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783721984 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783721984 -0400\n\nchore(code,evals,talon): bump `langgraph-runtime-inmem` to 0.31.0 (#4647)\n\nRaise `deepagents-code`'s minimum `langgraph-runtime-inmem` version to\n0.31.0 so installs resolve the runtime release expected by the current\nin-memory server stack.\n\nRefresh the affected workspace and example lockfiles to keep their\nresolved LangGraph API and runtime dependencies consistent.","verified_at":"2026-07-10T22:19:45Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e9c61304460baab2058a667198600cadef516954","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e9c61304460baab2058a667198600cadef516954","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e9c61304460baab2058a667198600cadef516954/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https:/