Nick Hollon","email":"nick.hollon@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-10T14:33:03Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-10T14:33:03Z"},"message":"perf(infra): install only the model integrations a Harbor job needs (#4623)\n\nOnly include the model integrations that the model list needs to improve\nthe performance of Harbor jobs.\n\nAlso fixes an issue where non-Fireworks jobs failed to install because\nof the Fireworks prerelease dependency: `langchain-fireworks` was being\ninstalled every time but without `prerelease=allow`.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b0cc1b7a6bb5cf894a1b182766122ad77f4949c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/3b0cc1b7a6bb5cf894a1b182766122ad77f4949c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/2915644e055f6de8c0b6a66d8568ec3ce96c2a74","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUQKfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgC8QAD7BhBJInHFULkpYCAb4PXP1\nbnTkgbAV4wVq5q0zX4S+vIvWJfnMiOHBkoFesRa8scq6nAUpllR5JOfaXUlRaok9\n5fJTI59JAW1Cyu2hPht74dqhLS6rDQFUOe4Di/hDgCHQjw99/pkB9yuXeY2dp7JL\nOGJNDgx8hLLkYPAWWZfFrETr+n//H06uKhJ11FSb4YBB4an/LQBfhDYAsgyeSoSO\nXPhtlaWFAkVaVM74KejZxXj5SkRDI4ngi8C8UkDxo419xdH2PIKHgb6Db8DAP3av\n0B8Lc65+ibull426YlY5kSzMYkrT2arKpn10xIT8Yf8h0x4qnfdI12BU+udgfcR6\nC5f2mUls/mzKw51NFncJhuYG2YXwvxIxV0E1Gvl5WVdL0VKP8z4AwCImMQg1K+a9\nMtirJM2TbAUFJyaXyJgvUxdI2DZWIO6FrR2dOV9tP2sms3uWM4nfitmcuj5rXDnt\nOrSmqK6U8lxfFM8FBkoukTOI01kCHjFoGnwEBupZ+CtkKxL2m50MPsMMpU93ejaU\nGU6GSV5ZDjTzsg/SGEe7m+PmoFKqis/HUdiatiRzgSsmyxJgQfynJ/Y3i4DCSou7\nVXVg726gT5jmZW3tG68VYOLQlTq81Y5gjDK3amM1CjSKx+XnzPzgPsJ46fDk8p2b\nS0BzHw6lsxOZm6yODe3y\n=KOC3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 3b0cc1b7a6bb5cf894a1b182766122ad77f4949c\nparent 4c721e642231e9494d03d7418e1e096e677707b9\nauthor Nick Hollon <nick.hollon@langchain.dev> 1783693983 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783693983 -0400\n\nperf(infra): install only the model integrations a Harbor job needs (#4623)\n\nOnly include the model integrations that the model list needs to improve\nthe performance of Harbor jobs.\n\nAlso fixes an issue where non-Fireworks jobs failed to install because\nof the Fireworks prerelease dependency: `langchain-fireworks` was being\ninstalled every time but without `prerelease=allow`.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-10T14:33:03Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2915644e055f6de8c0b6a66d8568ec3ce96c2a74","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2915644e055f6de8c0b6a66d8568ec3ce96c2a74","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2915644e055f6de8c0b6a66d8568ec3ce96c2a74/comments","author":{"login":"nick-hollon-lc","id":274035459,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFVzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274035459?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc","html_url":"https://github.com/nick-hollon-lc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"4c721e642231e9494d03d7418e1e096e677707b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/4c721e642231e9494d03d7418e1e096e677707b9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/4c721e642231e9494d03d7418e1e096e677707b9"}]},{"sha":"4c721e642231e9494d03d7418e1e096e677707b9","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDRjNzIxZTY0MjIzMWU5NDk0ZDAzZDc0MThlMWUwOTZlNjc3NzA3Yjk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nick Hollon","email":"nick.hollon@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-10T14:18:44Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-10T14:18:44Z"},"message":"feat(infra): give Harbor eval shards a shared per-dispatch LangSmith experiment (#4625)\n\nConverge a model's Harbor eval shards into one LangSmith experiment\ninstead of one per shard.\n\n**Change:** append `${GITHUB_RUN_ID}-${GITHUB_RUN_ATTEMPT}` to the\nexperiment name (+5/−1). Shards already share the name; the run suffix\nkeeps each dispatch/re-run its own experiment. `RUN_ID` = per dispatch,\n`RUN_ATTEMPT` = per re-run.\n\n**Why the suffix is newly needed:** Harbor's LangSmith plugin now uses\n`experiment_name` verbatim (create-or-reuse by name), so same-named\nshards converge, but it dropped the random per-job `-{job.id}` suffix\nthat used to keep runs distinct. Without our suffix, every dispatch\nwould reuse the first one's experiment.\n\n**Not a dependency / safe to merge anytime:** passing an experiment name\nis unchanged behavior. Convergence just activates once the running\nHarbor has the verbatim-name behavior (`harbor-langsmith 9940730f`); on\nolder builds it falls back to per-job experiments.\n\n**Tested:** haiku, `n_shards=2`, override → feature build; both shards\nused the same experiment, run passed.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2283a3b303ec0f46edec11a0081ce50672ec429","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/a2283a3b303ec0f46edec11a0081ce50672ec429"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/4c721e642231e9494d03d7418e1e096e677707b9","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUP9ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvQwQAG89rWMmAL6DQKhkEOaP5gvB\nkCQBI0061qFiQCtDxeRx0+BmPR1JIGlSz8/cSNfeeLS1qYvtFO6pKW7zQ29/k1Hi\n33zjCFWGwuCGw3fJB7QtAtHqYb15p/DYUeF7NWZjpdOU3CFlEl2DWGMROlSjRNsa\nFkF7g6heMsuYZ0ecP5eF0EvaOo1RZzQc46LY4FaWak7slpIVcwQeXh9glmMxymv7\n1Z6jsX0qMirK3fMt/VjfCvuW7B+W3yGxWThpFgT6Hzk5bfAE8xh4D+fETMrx8f+/\nMaMnEEPw3sFhgvW/90kgWaV/AOGzXA38qm9pYN6dR3Qhm/qJP254aS5B7igzAl79\nXwj9OemZ1Iyv0XcW+am3+gnH3KmsTl7J/oueWrkeLf3dkD1VnqSP/PWSHqAdo0Iw\nUuqaLG7rBOn4z5kf4pRtJmfDtszH8vQBVRLY2cS1ZJZ9bZbVV7ADmX1WELWbayHw\ndtvUXbgpvmuUGROz/saCjv7omUzMgMKYflGIaoGvC15SrUNyHoFcPgxqQNade9CZ\nK51vcTZq8wOMyYl5JErdhNDHsVWVw6HqcvkLRhYGiBBi+2V5ReiujsMjZAxzmMW8\nrppcQhvxCswWzZmX+pWT3jplyEXPhho0SNhwQw2HETXWujCLWLnT1Sr9UazSJWqw\nP+onZ7FkNxGesBevVBmG\n=qnbO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree a2283a3b303ec0f46edec11a0081ce50672ec429\nparent ddce7c3f524109b10ea13ef56afbd1ac99f9e300\nauthor Nick Hollon <nick.hollon@langchain.dev> 1783693124 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783693124 -0400\n\nfeat(infra): give Harbor eval shards a shared per-dispatch LangSmith experiment (#4625)\n\nConverge a model's Harbor eval shards into one LangSmith experiment\ninstead of one per shard.\n\n**Change:** append `${GITHUB_RUN_ID}-${GITHUB_RUN_ATTEMPT}` to the\nexperiment name (+5/−1). Shards already share the name; the run suffix\nkeeps each dispatch/re-run its own experiment. `RUN_ID` = per dispatch,\n`RUN_ATTEMPT` = per re-run.\n\n**Why the suffix is newly needed:** Harbor's LangSmith plugin now uses\n`experiment_name` verbatim (create-or-reuse by name), so same-named\nshards converge, but it dropped the random per-job `-{job.id}` suffix\nthat used to keep runs distinct. Without our suffix, every dispatch\nwould reuse the first one's experiment.\n\n**Not a dependency / safe to merge anytime:** passing an experiment name\nis unchanged behavior. Convergence just activates once the running\nHarbor has the verbatim-name behavior (`harbor-langsmith 9940730f`); on\nolder builds it falls back to per-job experiments.\n\n**Tested:** haiku, `n_shards=2`, override → feature build; both shards\nused the same experiment, run passed.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-10T14:18:45Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/4c721e642231e9494d03d7418e1e096e677707b9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/4c721e642231e9494d03d7418e1e096e677707b9","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/4c721e642231e9494d03d7418e1e096e677707b9/comments","author":{"login":"nick-hollon-lc","id":274035459,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFVzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274035459?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc","html_url":"https://github.com/nick-hollon-lc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ddce7c3f524109b10ea13ef56afbd1ac99f9e300","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ddce7c3f524109b10ea13ef56afbd1ac99f9e300","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ddce7c3f524109b10ea13ef56afbd1ac99f9e300"}]},{"sha":"ddce7c3f524109b10ea13ef56afbd1ac99f9e300","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGRkY2U3YzNmNTI0MTA5YjEwZWExM2VmNTZhZmJkMWFjOTlmOWUzMDA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-09T23:29:13Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-09T23:29:13Z"},"message":"chore(code): reframe dcode pyproject description as coding agent (#4610)\n\nThe `deepagents-code` (`dcode`) `pyproject.toml` description still\nframed the package as a generic \"terminal interface for Deep Agents.\"\nIt's now the terminal coding agent, so this updates the description to\nmatch how it's presented in the [Deep Agents Code\ndocs](https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/deepagents/code/overview) —\na coding agent built on the Deep Agents SDK that works with any model\nand offers persistent memory, skills, subagents, and approval controls.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/4029725a-6556-b6f4-d30c-9929727823e0)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"da3452e1bc3a0c2d5282a14775998a8d5cdcda52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/da3452e1bc3a0c2d5282a14775998a8d5cdcda52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/ddce7c3f524109b10ea13ef56afbd1ac99f9e300","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUC7JCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaMwQAINxiWUR7WCkBn387bU7e+lO\nLez3w8e+dzJr76iQq4yWUfaDgiaiAqcAts+QOI3tq2ZkmGryVp5bL+/fr2/lCVeS\ns7dgvRryOap09iwz46Ka6iHtO6mxgQpF9MO7XBMHCYpd2cLt7K/MpQ9vemwMOHO8\nZY85CSl2aGnTY/tJAFu7h2P/OmMD/u2X9NyT5qzUJXwyqmpAOSPMiN7nfSg/U6hw\n+jghpqzsmAMfblydAleknaQygCbXgQMjhRLiAay3I33ZURbBLPAYVao7TlQhXFou\n7GQy8JJxC0EQ5FeOtdQI0TuXfQuC1KXSYZjZVw5m/Gg3xdYqykLWIdw+LXh7bhVE\naJcJedWbSKiGCvPGzU+if57XqOAlLI7fHtewy4R0lLLlkzHoiiQtlzDtEbQkyzs/\nnd+kPQu7Rvewr3rYz0amtyLNStWtQgJ1QQ4GOoprEoA9qMmp8lkVCVDf97tAltSz\nQAI/Vrgdh7vecioo6w28YI3aptxq4WpX0RIsXE8xxs+YBzLQGbmza1gjVwMgPMCr\n1SmqK5wRdENQCAF911VeVb92u56i/VkrRm0q9D78v+ospzULna0AoNlqMePSfjLj\n2WxuiZNYiUu0p7QA6DDImPFH7o2MSj4vPubfNWH3SCwnNHsdDuF/GhI5VjQDDMar\nEgZiAAAcoFlMzoz37dA4\n=s4zs\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree da3452e1bc3a0c2d5282a14775998a8d5cdcda52\nparent 997be1643aff6d6900b8b8c95832cdf93be8c0d7\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783639753 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783639753 -0400\n\nchore(code): reframe dcode pyproject description as coding agent (#4610)\n\nThe `deepagents-code` (`dcode`) `pyproject.toml` description still\nframed the package as a generic \"terminal interface for Deep Agents.\"\nIt's now the terminal coding agent, so this updates the description to\nmatch how it's presented in the [Deep Agents Code\ndocs](https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/deepagents/code/overview) —\na coding agent built on the Deep Agents SDK that works with any model\nand offers persistent memory, skills, subagents, and approval controls.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/4029725a-6556-b6f4-d30c-9929727823e0)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-09T23:29:13Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ddce7c3f524109b10ea13ef56afbd1ac99f9e300","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/ddce7c3f524109b10ea13ef56afbd1ac99f9e300","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/ddce7c3f524109b10ea13ef56afbd1ac99f9e300/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"997be1643aff6d6900b8b8c95832cdf93be8c0d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/997be1643aff6d6900b8b8c95832cdf93be8c0d7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/997be1643aff6d6900b8b8c95832cdf93be8c0d7"}]},{"sha":"997be1643aff6d6900b8b8c95832cdf93be8c0d7","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDk5N2JlMTY0M2FmZjZkNjkwMGI4YjhjOTU4MzJjZGY5M2JlOGMwZDc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-09T22:31:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-09T22:31:26Z"},"message":"fix(code): reject `--auto-approve` in headless mode (#4617)\n\n`dcode` now rejects `--auto-approve` in headless mode and points users\nto `--shell-allow-list` for shell access. Interactive behavior is\nunchanged.\n\n---\n\nRunning `dcode` headlessly with `--auto-approve` currently accepts a\nflag that does not control shell access. This can leave users believing\nshell commands are approved when headless execution actually uses\n`--shell-allow-list`.\n\nReject the unsupported combination with exit code 2 and direct users to\n`--shell-allow-list`. Clarify the command help while preserving\n`--auto-approve` for interactive launches, including `-m` startup\nmessages.","tree":{"sha":"8d968a2165961c99d30dcf1963e06b80a0e6e357","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/8d968a2165961c99d30dcf1963e06b80a0e6e357"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/997be1643aff6d6900b8b8c95832cdf93be8c0d7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUCE+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8wsQAFghLFcydvUbSlEk3zLAUasS\n7aLyvhIlKB/U8JhGdUB1yiBvDe2pOv5lRAV1DyITrs+xMRaGdFKG+G2gGXBM+gB4\nI5JmdxTa4znd1NBDHSfF/ZMuZdnCjTe+UxHSp4eunF9tmAEaEkVJOJ2x3q0gIDS7\nppzh6ekAVZZPykuMP3eAtwu2LourNlv0HmxJUUAKp1LOn0l7KwMoj3SYBUrVaP6B\nBhlnrMatc3I0IDyQI/Tph2MAHxYMOSM4Vm2YNnnWmY75kPvzNFUfsI1VUIDLxsf3\nROYKXjI8T4DxCBNn0QaiwZmT0dbD+aZZ8j3fc6kzI7nGQUgMXYnfOTOrkph0x9VQ\nbQ9tryFlfNC1Kle8LYwtpxloftD286MLg+VUlKJ/C+z8XOy5C2Xy/RcARZB6sPNk\nXktCHQALlteUsXCco+jION0lRxGb4+OnC4qZkeb2T1whOP7ph5uTBfuOvDKO/tKA\niunGsiWo+me1jXEAzdRcVkbNrazmqscJOuDkE6TQjEhxssEDoT/F7/9xugnDSMxB\nknvbVnB9wDZnLWlBEtCsPRwjTHHX/sR8UG7eboIRkIKKuZoa/aQk3ZDNyqf/p203\nRENS3rjdnAPtJl85fK1/4uW4vh4YiwQX8P6R2htBbt0mz1dhQwj9QQqsNbWgnv3O\n4O6cZVncldSSPoBJvjKp\n=YpC3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 8d968a2165961c99d30dcf1963e06b80a0e6e357\nparent 3d1a9a94507022655e5070253c9252dae151cac9\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783636286 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783636286 -0400\n\nfix(code): reject `--auto-approve` in headless mode (#4617)\n\n`dcode` now rejects `--auto-approve` in headless mode and points users\nto `--shell-allow-list` for shell access. Interactive behavior is\nunchanged.\n\n---\n\nRunning `dcode` headlessly with `--auto-approve` currently accepts a\nflag that does not control shell access. This can leave users believing\nshell commands are approved when headless execution actually uses\n`--shell-allow-list`.\n\nReject the unsupported combination with exit code 2 and direct users to\n`--shell-allow-list`. Clarify the command help while preserving\n`--auto-approve` for interactive launches, including `-m` startup\nmessages.","verified_at":"2026-07-09T22:31:27Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/997be1643aff6d6900b8b8c95832cdf93be8c0d7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/997be1643aff6d6900b8b8c95832cdf93be8c0d7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/997be1643aff6d6900b8b8c95832cdf93be8c0d7/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"3d1a9a94507022655e5070253c9252dae151cac9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3d1a9a94507022655e5070253c9252dae151cac9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3d1a9a94507022655e5070253c9252dae151cac9"}]},{"sha":"3d1a9a94507022655e5070253c9252dae151cac9","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDNkMWE5YTk0NTA3MDIyNjU1ZTUwNzAyNTNjOTI1MmRhZTE1MWNhYzk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-09T22:06:03Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-09T22:06:03Z"},"message":"feat(infra): expand GitHub Action inputs (#4614)\n\nThe Deep Agents Code GitHub Action now supports headless options for\nmodel configuration, skills, startup commands, sandboxes, MCP,\ninterpreter tools, turn and task limits, rubric grading, stdin, quiet\noutput, buffered output, and JSON output.\n\n---\n\nThe root GitHub Action exposed only a small subset of headless `dcode`\noptions, so workflows could not configure skills, sandboxes, MCP,\ninterpreter tools, rubric grading, model parameters, or output modes\nwithout bypassing the Action.\n\nThis expands the Action input surface to match supported headless\n`dcode` behavior while deliberately keeping interactive-only\n`--auto-approve` out of workflows. Inputs are assembled as shell\nargument arrays, typed values are validated before launch, stdin and\ntimeout handling preserve the agent's actual exit code, and memory\ncaching now includes SQLite WAL files. `ACTION.md` documents the common\ninputs, outputs, memory behavior, and the need to treat agent output as\nuntrusted.\n\nThe Action tests compare forwarded flags with the CLI parser and execute\nthe real command-assembly shell against stubbed processes, covering\nvalidation, timeout arithmetic, stdin behavior, and exit-code\npropagation.","tree":{"sha":"64801cc89d418812d6d41763ebc92e8fd043a67d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/64801cc89d418812d6d41763ebc92e8fd043a67d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/3d1a9a94507022655e5070253c9252dae151cac9","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUBtLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbawQADNNs/S0IjZZoQWzKSSJl4Ch\nXpactvt5mnhz/3G4wxHMGDIW45rFvQg4oNXb+8OSKlYgOcSN9Xqdf445FFP59XFH\nId81XV5aiOA7HCQRKP/A0fVTz2gB1j+4lAlFPxKPQFXesXJo9lsMycLbYw1Dh9Oy\neFVUKe3nDroX/AQW0+42IukghP+UIPQPKTxTWIjhyUauDL2IIBIBTcp3yHLu1UmL\neF7Xffyd0ryxnEpfgq+g3gx6kyT3ZT24ZeoyOCsX2dTTWDIfyotpuS82h99WXSOQ\nxhw2afjh6tv8Jicquk7fJOFRAyKfrEHzBAPMZs/gLTQW0/1sTeMz6HTGFMHOaBCY\nr+SA0XqdnKG5qzCiKA1wL4/n6Z+d05PE4GPNhjk6FA3J3c8PBL3HOiy+Vj/z60xn\nVe181HdawGQUqEJXyK2kmVgLRUAim7aEqSOAQFpwbJ/XoShY7uqoVWgZanFFQcNc\nyfLL2N8VEXJAE4i1XzXQLM75u72dSpVztjQpgPq7wLnP9jBdbUaZfqTFys7VchFI\nnoBRH2hdwuNd+T+YuiEm3e3anYl/Ijq3JW9mhSds34V5xDR+0abYeFcSXSJvU0o7\nRnTWC0oJgPxXGCkzVE5ftcD/sobz5XopUofVfcAgW2PJIqEr+6QoUqi1+tb4mmby\nOC/uPICLP+ck3DA3SKHa\n=/jDe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 64801cc89d418812d6d41763ebc92e8fd043a67d\nparent a4662c07296c378045006c9f45ed1d12bd1a9da6\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783634763 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783634763 -0400\n\nfeat(infra): expand GitHub Action inputs (#4614)\n\nThe Deep Agents Code GitHub Action now supports headless options for\nmodel configuration, skills, startup commands, sandboxes, MCP,\ninterpreter tools, turn and task limits, rubric grading, stdin, quiet\noutput, buffered output, and JSON output.\n\n---\n\nThe root GitHub Action exposed only a small subset of headless `dcode`\noptions, so workflows could not configure skills, sandboxes, MCP,\ninterpreter tools, rubric grading, model parameters, or output modes\nwithout bypassing the Action.\n\nThis expands the Action input surface to match supported headless\n`dcode` behavior while deliberately keeping interactive-only\n`--auto-approve` out of workflows. Inputs are assembled as shell\nargument arrays, typed values are validated before launch, stdin and\ntimeout handling preserve the agent's actual exit code, and memory\ncaching now includes SQLite WAL files. `ACTION.md` documents the common\ninputs, outputs, memory behavior, and the need to treat agent output as\nuntrusted.\n\nThe Action tests compare forwarded flags with the CLI parser and execute\nthe real command-assembly shell against stubbed processes, covering\nvalidation, timeout arithmetic, stdin behavior, and exit-code\npropagation.","verified_at":"2026-07-09T22:06:04Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3d1a9a94507022655e5070253c9252dae151cac9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3d1a9a94507022655e5070253c9252dae151cac9","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3d1a9a94507022655e5070253c9252dae151cac9/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"a4662c07296c378045006c9f45ed1d12bd1a9da6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a4662c07296c378045006c9f45ed1d12bd1a9da6","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a4662c07296c378045006c9f45ed1d12bd1a9da6"}]},{"sha":"a4662c07296c378045006c9f45ed1d12bd1a9da6","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGE0NjYyYzA3Mjk2YzM3ODA0NTAwNmM5ZjQ1ZWQxZDEyYmQxYTlkYTY","commit":{"author":{"name":"John Kennedy","email":"65985482+jkennedyvz@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-09T19:55:31Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-09T19:55:31Z"},"message":"fix(sdk): isolate private custom state from subagents (#4587)\n\nPrivate fields declared on caller-provided state schemas were not\nincluded in subagent private-state filtering, so they could be copied\ninto raw subagent state. This includes the top-level schema in the\nprivate-key set and applies the same filter to subagent state updates so\nthose fields stay confined to the owning agent.\n\nFocused validation passed: targeted subagent privacy pytest, `ruff\ncheck`, `ruff format`, `ty check deepagents`, and `git diff --check`.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/67e6d983-bccd-a1df-52c9-9198e278262d)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf41fe4857fe882bfcd369476808c58c397169d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/bf41fe4857fe882bfcd369476808c58c397169d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/a4662c07296c378045006c9f45ed1d12bd1a9da6","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqT/yzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtpsQAHF/zt/sr9VlSkLzf5YBD1yX\nWh5KRWHUaBZ09JDJqf551kMXHrxPWCanuj/8SJ1LKRO6eu67zOGRrIb5++MKZAdI\nZwO/HUt5i3XJ5ZRDaAxLSvjTGubjJMOK1FNYC0dGcj6fFPuHDfKtsLQMWIgsPB6u\nUud7+SddH/FfNZKaElMzqCDV/My6ANJjO4BZ5+sw9Vayh9vbfieylwhKCo3vvDRD\nxyK19bauxGZvTm3Ren2Q2cjBsNVWAk3INHLkm6jjnpL9B/Knj4U1kuR3EnPhRM6K\ni0DEjDbEwbDHnusvjcXIHsHgcDU4a8u1EK+g0czcaCohAPZsXfQMPsMwFjpGhxqa\nrLBy28B5gvVe21ZH+5yUkiA+zjD+MbyK5bAuFxHYwkf5IcWgaYFDWRknB6ua9EG2\nWPlhujY8HGmpz5h9UxvG+QvVOXb1YaK4B+tSRrwdRWVXKMZ14Uho+U+tgR74YCi+\neI/wt7i+/JvN4MjbgAAUeccRPNDA0poRPRUlJV9qz8f1M4L6Lr1nu7ySjACa6JBF\nYVoNnenQsakKr5nYaKuvD818xc7FFJZ51NRy/R0ethd7+hO0YXuAQZqtMiCCBEkl\n22bCvPxmJq0dbRa2OotukGY2iQ7kSS+iIXRflD1bNpwm/UPekonFT6FkuTPAVg9s\njWXLIJDd3Y6y6dkpHbtn\n=ECZn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree bf41fe4857fe882bfcd369476808c58c397169d7\nparent 2f56309d821db4a0d06ee03959cf842c91b7f228\nauthor John Kennedy <65985482+jkennedyvz@users.noreply.github.com> 1783626931 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783626931 -0400\n\nfix(sdk): isolate private custom state from subagents (#4587)\n\nPrivate fields declared on caller-provided state schemas were not\nincluded in subagent private-state filtering, so they could be copied\ninto raw subagent state. This includes the top-level schema in the\nprivate-key set and applies the same filter to subagent state updates so\nthose fields stay confined to the owning agent.\n\nFocused validation passed: targeted subagent privacy pytest, `ruff\ncheck`, `ruff format`, `ty check deepagents`, and `git diff --check`.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/67e6d983-bccd-a1df-52c9-9198e278262d)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-09T19:55:31Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a4662c07296c378045006c9f45ed1d12bd1a9da6","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a4662c07296c378045006c9f45ed1d12bd1a9da6","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a4662c07296c378045006c9f45ed1d12bd1a9da6/comments","author":{"login":"jkennedyvz","id":65985482,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1OTg1NDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65985482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz","html_url":"https://github.com/jkennedyvz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"2f56309d821db4a0d06ee03959cf842c91b7f228","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2f56309d821db4a0d06ee03959cf842c91b7f228","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2f56309d821db4a0d06ee03959cf842c91b7f228"}]},{"sha":"2f56309d821db4a0d06ee03959cf842c91b7f228","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDJmNTYzMDlkODIxZGI0YTBkMDZlZTAzOTU5Y2Y4NDJjOTFiN2YyMjg","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-09T19:35:27Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-09T19:35:27Z"},"message":"release(deepagents-code): 0.1.36 (#4595)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Release notes preview: keep this section in sync with the package\n`CHANGELOG.md`. The published GitHub release body is extracted from the\nmerged `CHANGELOG.md` by `release.yml`, not from this PR description._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.36](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.35...deepagents-code==0.1.36)\n(2026-07-09)\n\n### Features\n\n* Add `GPT-5.6` model family\n([#4600](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4600))\n([4a806bc](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/4a806bc703b69334cccd05bcd27d411602e82318))\n* Add Grok 4.5 model\n([#4596](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4596))\n([b0a209d](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b0a209da3a8c9f80e2e3d5e199340736c854c567))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Strip input before Ctrl+C copy-input fallback\n([#4590](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4590))\n([505d55a](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/505d55ad83e8569213175911ee6c8c39fbbf340c))\n\n---\n\n_End release notes preview._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"99291dc8dc5bb7cbda627aa01bd49a38aae12b80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/99291dc8dc5bb7cbda627aa01bd49a38aae12b80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/2f56309d821db4a0d06ee03959cf842c91b7f228","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqT/f/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAp00QAABDNdMIjCuzykFTd/zus87S\nYeTfTmistS7eK/Bap9hJ3o7NN7bwsgURiRCAq5b55daSTxYwdo0j07VDQEAoSXKO\n0M4TCSvhpIcnXKM/n7PVnfr5UdkJYiuwJT3gXICXSLSnLxvzOAvzwwBPCiYrM3jI\ntl/jUZ1igsPxUQq4i3xkkK0uIN/N38b+FnS3ALk6FOnnf5Ps+HBiXLGKOwRV6AK3\n2rjYtL6u5PIEzqgt+3Nv3f8q40JToCWJmIPwTDSlIlmW+yeYnftyOan2iJFex6GT\nwJPVnZH9/cWq9PTSJqYzSn+qbSSK/qAarXJR04v7YbUO51KYG8LrnD4OV5Bk+vWx\nQqb3eM6pm4JTjUKVWtPwprEnkBy2/rsMWTFZfD5U3QcsisUtEnjGA8L2jU7TTIp2\nzJLDXtacl2rOtN2N0c6jHxpv/xsyuN2mMp3DHgAED05s3a1KE8Sp6p7XyddrF7US\nAd4k79QZnJrwNbU8vDOZEKbSKJPUKblTyDmJk764Gh4FMoxxU/GnwWk136aPiLLi\nAC/FTsQGcEt4Nl6OvqNWfhC42ltfKapHW5kCfnyknDjJB/3EjSPkjOQH3nH7kTiW\n4eqOmdm1yXRuqagip7NL6OTpiXUBd5X2LkCrZR+4/VO5QCaefRfXfspwurb7gkCh\nQds+elZkRwXcjMJKTYWc\n=9eEM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 99291dc8dc5bb7cbda627aa01bd49a38aae12b80\nparent 0867f164403163d507d98ef3e8fb916e78833426\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1783625727 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783625727 -0400\n\nrelease(deepagents-code): 0.1.36 (#4595)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Release notes preview: keep this section in sync with the package\n`CHANGELOG.md`. The published GitHub release body is extracted from the\nmerged `CHANGELOG.md` by `release.yml`, not from this PR description._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.36](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.35...deepagents-code==0.1.36)\n(2026-07-09)\n\n### Features\n\n* Add `GPT-5.6` model family\n([#4600](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4600))\n([4a806bc](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/4a806bc703b69334cccd05bcd27d411602e82318))\n* Add Grok 4.5 model\n([#4596](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4596))\n([b0a209d](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b0a209da3a8c9f80e2e3d5e199340736c854c567))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Strip input before Ctrl+C copy-input fallback\n([#4590](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4590))\n([505d55a](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/505d55ad83e8569213175911ee6c8c39fbbf340c))\n\n---\n\n_End release notes preview._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-09T19:35:27Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2f56309d821db4a0d06ee03959cf842c91b7f228","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2f56309d821db4a0d06ee03959cf842c91b7f228","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/2f56309d821db4a0d06ee03959cf842c91b7f228/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/