ivacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"d30644bdf35d1cef72f21daebeecf946d5af6fde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d30644bdf35d1cef72f21daebeecf946d5af6fde","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d30644bdf35d1cef72f21daebeecf946d5af6fde"}]},{"sha":"d30644bdf35d1cef72f21daebeecf946d5af6fde","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGQzMDY0NGJkZjM1ZDFjZWY3MmYyMWRhZWJlZWNmOTQ2ZDVhZjZmZGU","commit":{"author":{"name":"dependabot[bot]","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-09T18:40:21Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-09T18:40:21Z"},"message":"chore(deps): bump soupsieve from 2.8.3 to 2.8.4 in /libs/evals (#4603)\n\nBumps [soupsieve](https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve) from 2.8.3\nto 2.8.4.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/releases\">soupsieve's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>2.8.4</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>FIX</strong>: Fix another inefficient attribute pattern (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mauriceng98\"><code>@​mauriceng98</code></a>).</li>\n<li><strong>FIX</strong>: Limit total number of selectors processed in a\npattern to prevent massive selector requests (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mauriceng98\"><code>@​mauriceng98</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/28108ab805818c832d9568142a99844fd95a0d39\"><code>28108ab</code></a>\nLimit excessive selectors</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/ef188721d6cc95641e99297b3a26ac17b7dfcfa7\"><code>ef18872</code></a>\nFix test for Windows</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/eb4397618709186c109400448c6043b728217dc3\"><code>eb43976</code></a>\nMerge commit from fork</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/3a661b23b20e92b49b4683f0227c26c9d765267f\"><code>3a661b2</code></a>\nFix typo in pseudo-classes.md (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/issues/294\">#294</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/commit/0cb533d83bfc445c7c6321742a21f612305fc8ba\"><code>0cb533d</code></a>\nUpdate hatchling version requirement in pyproject.toml (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/issues/290\">#290</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/facelessuser/soupsieve/compare/2.8.3...2.8.4\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=soupsieve&package-manager=uv&previous-version=2.8.3&new-version=2.8.4)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\nYou can disable automated security fix PRs for this repo from the\n[Security Alerts\npage](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/network/alerts).\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b710fdf3be188165a2c7037ab1cc840ed7f1aee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/9b710fdf3be188165a2c7037ab1cc840ed7f1aee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/d30644bdf35d1cef72f21daebeecf946d5af6fde","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqT+sVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVBEQACEqDIt5KJskV2k4SEWFUm4X\np8W9rDw1oDrdxU7x++No27ca2oMcV4YJ08ejmKuTj/t1t9XS3DuCNvmLV0VTgMw7\niioB4eAHliVccK66sNkCaSi14R/vmxKImPSO4pPqi8XIiHNiCow1pHyZGu+PZsih\nBqNgR1PW6OhzgrM8Lrm287ssZY2YX1vxIvIeb+Ul5izGiitsGUixMQGkrm9ZFcVG\nTPLo7gXtKcBOo7YuqueCFWsOv76GvirogAKsIb/CvVL/bmtR709AbX7mCU4yGbT6\nKqCXEKhZXUrx+IVo8p+54StOYS4aE52alxFuV8Q35n80SqmcQCPyIqWDNCFiQ6PK\nmltAfByhjerJpDY0KVkZF3qSDTB0G8wU9/FrMvboLbUUybQz2LUBAmeCf4cqIDPy\nngogw0+hOm5cHDmUAt1zVP74iZ0qaV3mDgPgfp4HUhcWQSdLvKm0kV75BLxaoJNr\nyj+/NOFuUTVKi0L9bLfYzBC6qFL7xPrg5/HIvSSDFvyTcpdwufS1fYU8QuBnEQBv\n1Ef+cKz4uWinitEld2jsugEmQwSTWaPxpfkMoy1UhdkFevtz3hKFwV47HwjKFfOe\nbIAt+VSMIfKurrgkUYp4950/vSj9OlaEpVJEHo6p3lNC+T5dERCB5Fg9Ou2eGfAm\nWIYnivigsRHrZmvtU7Bm\n=DTy2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 9b710fdf3be188165a2c7037ab1cc840ed7f1aee\nparent 44daa243bb960f9c1ecb1b5ee734153e9430b0da\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1783622421 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 178