tps://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b0a209da3a8c9f80e2e3d5e199340736c854c567/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c6c72139b3ee7d090f657dd19ced59a9bbc41140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c6c72139b3ee7d090f657dd19ced59a9bbc41140","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c6c72139b3ee7d090f657dd19ced59a9bbc41140"}]},{"sha":"c6c72139b3ee7d090f657dd19ced59a9bbc41140","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGM2YzcyMTM5YjNlZTdkMDkwZjY1N2RkMTljZWQ1OWE5YmJjNDExNDA","commit":{"author":{"name":"langsmith-fleet[bot]","email":"242644093+langsmith-fleet[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-09T15:11:27Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-09T15:11:27Z"},"message":"fix(langsmith-sandbox): sandbox glob path boundary checks (#4588)\n\nFixes sandbox filesystem boundary issues reported by Corridor:\n\n- Treat `BaseSandbox.glob()` patterns as search-root-relative by\nstripping leading `/`, rejecting `..` segments, and enforcing `realpath`\ncontainment before returning matches.\n- Harden slash-glob `BaseSandbox.grep()` by rejecting traversal patterns\nand enforcing `realpath` containment before opening candidate files.\n- Add regression tests for absolute/anchored glob behavior, traversal\nrejection, and symlink escape filtering.\n\nFollow-up: keep the inline Python templates shell-safe when executed\nthrough the sandbox command wrapper, and preserve `glob()`'s existing\nsearch-root-relative return paths.\n\nCorridor findings addressed:\n-\nhttps://app.corridor.dev/projects/ec13e000-fc8e-442c-a6a6-583b5d24876c/findings/0e20f5c7-ce83-435c-91bd-84d00db27406\n-\nhttps://app.corridor.dev/projects/ec13e000-fc8e-442c-a6a6-583b5d24876c/findings/c50efbb4-1db5-4c82-9a4c-f64f0a0e6500\n\nTests run:\n- `uv run --directory /workspace/deepagents/libs/deepagents pytest\ntests/unit_tests/backends/test_sandbox_backend.py\ntests/unit_tests/test_permissions.py -q --disable-socket\n--allow-unix-socket --benchmark-disable --no-header --tb=short`\n- `RUN_SANDBOX_TESTS=true uv run --directory\n/workspace/deepagents/libs/deepagents pytest\ntests/unit_tests/test_local_sandbox_operations.py -q -k 'not\npermission_denied' --disable-socket --allow-unix-socket\n--benchmark-disable --no-header --tb=short`\n- `uv run --directory /workspace/deepagents/libs/deepagents --all-groups\nruff format deepagents/backends/sandbox.py\ntests/unit_tests/backends/test_sandbox_backend.py`\n- `uv run --directory /workspace/deepagents/libs/deepagents --all-groups\nruff check deepagents/backends/sandbox.py\ntests/unit_tests/backends/test_sandbox_backend.py`\n\nNote: local permission-denied sandbox tests fail in this root sandbox\nbecause `chmod 000` does not deny root reads/writes; CI runs them as a\nnon-root user.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/9255fe21-2fe3-8922-4b36-f3c70776ca79)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Langster <john@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: John Kennedy <65985482+jkennedyvz@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"01193e827cee7f8ba7c7f9fd9bce1ef08c1e9bda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/01193e827cee7f8ba7c7f9fd9bce1ef08c1e9bda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/c6c72139b3ee7d090f657dd19ced59a9bbc41140","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqT7ofCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAq8cQAJR/eIAWAshTGwZT44u5tmRl\nN6rmrWFbOnFWwe9Rvd7XrDyfDBkSVOW5yBKvjy7r+5NF1jS9e3G1aXjy2Hwq557L\ns0/jzVGNz4R6FMhC2Lt92r3JI+b18Da1bCstIr3SsvHqcM92bKbKOPJ/yC62bGvK\niVYkzg27ibwRpayMXCfil/J4RoSUs+10h5qCcrmCZ+QboL7GxUt5ZIblfox8Hv0N\nRRxhvcbd12g9WwYDcNEoWLIAnxdTSFsryA9JQaxsCWr4a+YZATcDIi9cSKvr1XY1\nkH9bVPB3fXZpmmSb5fNzXAOvWW5uZy/wHVB31AwjfpHGUlkqk/1ZHBj3IVy68Y2i\nqgqSzMnWmQFsoJn/VqaOOogaDYUboJcF8ZDZHN7SkRe0iGv171mdNPFG2Uk9JlWy\ncmmCP/BPBzLM7llM6Vhc1nhSHmAq4/pqczPNEtI5YFPshylIjakb6BPLYUEuztqV\n8k9v7mM6lwrnEco1v96imgNCXNcJMrqx87igU2J9AogE7hyHiUjkmOCWo8NzHfsu\nJ+8ffo85zSnSrYGKejTI8lpMWB8gUP57tL+sH+dqWoBM97oWgoihBGIIBJcUosN5\n/Y443Q0OfL1PYTJCpAC0B9bBg2K25LHmebAJSbcf7Mu6mm6ER1zrsWoxymm9OAnY\nm7Lnz6JqX6zK73/tCdK8\n=1Krr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 01193e827cee7f8ba7c7f9fd9bce1ef08c1e9bda\nparent 505d55ad83e8569213175911ee6c8c39fbbf340c\nauthor langsmith-fleet[bot] <242644093+langsmith-fleet[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1783609887 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783609887 -0400\n\nfix(langsmith-sandbox): sandbox glob path boundary checks (#4588)\n\nFixes sandbox filesystem boundary issues reported by Corridor:\n\n- Treat `BaseSandbox.glob()` patterns as search-root-relative by\nstripping leading `/`, rejecting `..` segments, and enforcing `realpath`\ncontainment before returning matches.\n- Harden slash-glob `BaseSandbox.grep()` by rejecting traversal patterns\nand enforcing `realpath` containment before opening candidate files.\n- Add regression tests for absolute/anchored glob behavior, traversal\nrejection, and symlink escape filtering.\n\nFollow-up: keep the inline Python templates shell-safe when executed\nthrough the sandbox command wrapper, and preserve `glob()`'s existing\nsearch-root-relative return paths.\n\nCorridor findings addressed:\n-\nhttps://app.corridor.dev/projects/ec13e000-fc8e-442c-a6a6-583b5d24876c/findings/0e20f5c7-ce83-435c-91bd-84d00db27406\n-\nhttps://app.corridor.dev/projects/ec13e000-fc8e-442c-a6a6-583b5d24876c/findings/c50efbb4-1db5-4c82-9a4c-f64f0a0e6500\n\nTests run:\n- `uv run --directory /workspace/deepagents/libs/deepagents pytest\ntests/unit_tests/backends/test_sandbox_backend.py\ntests/unit_tests/test_permissions.py -q --disable-socket\n--allow-unix-socket --benchmark-disable --no-header --tb=short`\n- `RUN_SANDBOX_TESTS=true uv run --directory\n/workspace/deepagents/libs/deepagents pytest\ntests/unit_tests/test_local_sandbox_operations.py -q -k 'not\npermission_denied' --disable-socket --allow-unix-socket\n--benchmark-disable --no-header --tb=short`\n- `uv run --directory /workspace/deepagents/libs/deepagents --all-groups\nruff format deepagents/backends/sandbox.py\ntests/unit_tests/backends/test_sandbox_backend.py`\n- `uv run --directory /workspace/deepagents/libs/deepagents --all-groups\nruff check deepagents/backends/sandbox.py\ntests/unit_tests/backends/test_sandbox_backend.py`\n\nNote: local permission-denied sandbox tests fail in this root sandbox\nbecause `chmod 000` does not deny root reads/writes; CI runs them as a\nnon-root user.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/9255fe21-2fe3-8922-4b36-f3c70776ca79)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Langster <john@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: John Kennedy <65985482+jkennedyvz@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-09T15:11:27Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c6c72139b3ee7d090f657dd19ced59a9bbc41140","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c6c72139b3ee7d090f657dd19ced59a9bbc41140","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c6c72139b3ee7d090f657dd19ced59a9bbc41140/comments","author":{"login":"langsmith-fleet[bot]","id":242644093,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODnZ0fQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/2251985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/langsmith-fleet%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/langsmith-fleet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langsmith-fleet%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langsmith-fleet%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langsmith-fleet%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langsmith-fleet%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langsmith-fleet%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/langsmith-fleet%5Bbot%5D