 row. The fix keeps the\ncompact box layout, selects one weighted tip per banner instance, and\nrestores the `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_HIDE_SPLASH_TIPS` opt-out.\n\n### Screenshots\n<img width=\"750\" height=\"760\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-06 at 2 06 44 PM\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/feadd944-dad0-4813-bf19-d4465b2b3843\"\n/>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"f348f4060aa814f9e9d76054183b9bb402453318","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/f348f4060aa814f9e9d76054183b9bb402453318"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/3f1e55eafbc1fde79cb75f631561cf35d4b8ff4c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTsibCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAE+YQAGidziWWDo50jGvIhojWEzmc\nJyCZeEmxBeCuxft4YWquQCugeG/cXjSl2DjK+MgSYLiSKypNIwh0CkwAfWE6lwVC\nkNoNCHOCOKumhgGVJUbiLdv9+xxpQBht1VxE1/9HgKqJmogpwIyKy8zNLDoFx6OC\nEa4eAgR7hWgMz9qsy6Ts3o/TSediGnflOcXJz3J9xTvtGkuwWmVCGdFy3q7nJ3yV\n8li4f7hq03AqnkqI1QzkuCJhENRFDNrjiUgzpF/UVLMzin0qykqrVy4+teYRmRD7\nvX/W0hTW/GlGQ1VrGxYQkrFhjZRsCi78aVAEO4UzBmCcBNRdiWugnrm3YjQ9rg5H\neDMnkcHVHbD96Zulz0eZ7X/UnXrhGrwszpic7coKXG4Vz0N+8Iv4SnpL0Sh4HVFx\nigji8Xya6RQ8f2Qh80dJaKjmOqgUyffxeIVjijLyuMuhNH7XQomQNPboJdkXSLvK\nhMx0t7PaaUJVfWT5UIB6wWRsGgmQiJnrSurBUlBtTYqaJrbpRLkTgkyAmqYUXQPS\no4S8ltzZ3z3pFEqnZqNiwZ1PCFC5kMJG3Lt19GaWsfTdIsoDiiSWTk4WOw9/tE3L\nqg3YuuZSlWqgp2DbfbCVZvod5FTByo6Raf/P+ii8Gyqb4ubMRzj96itW8F0AbDaw\nWMwNSlLUmdkzEVw6gQeX\n=hsz+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree f348f4060aa814f9e9d76054183b9bb402453318\nparent f183c1b2172c8dcbcee45ef1a6fe3ed56872cc15\nauthor Johannes du Plessis <johannes@langchain.dev> 1783548059 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783548059 -0400\n\nfix(code): restore welcome banner tips (#4528)\n\nRestores rotating startup tips to the compact Deep Agents Code welcome\nbanner after the banner rewrite removed the tip row. The fix keeps the\ncompact box layout, selects one weighted tip per banner instance, and\nrestores the `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_HIDE_SPLASH_TIPS` opt-out.\n\n### Screenshots\n<img width=\"750\" height=\"760\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-07-06 at 2 06 44 PM\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/feadd944-dad0-4813-bf19-d4465b2b3843\"\n/>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-08T22:01:00Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3f1e55eafbc1fde79cb75f631561cf35d4b8ff4c","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3f1e55eafbc1fde79cb75f631561cf35d4b8ff4c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3f1e55eafbc1fde79cb75f631561cf35d4b8ff4c/comments","author":{"login":"johannes117","id":51395795,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzk1Nzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51395795?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117","html_url":"https://github.com/johannes117","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johannes117/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f183c1b2172c8dcbcee45ef1a6fe3ed56872cc15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f183c1b2172c8dcbcee45ef1a6fe3ed56872cc15","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f183c1b2172c8dcbcee45ef1a6fe3ed56872cc15"}]},{"sha":"f183c1b2172c8dcbcee45ef1a6fe3ed56872cc15","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGYxODNjMWIyMTcyYzhkY2JjZWU0NWVmMWE2ZmUzZWQ1Njg3MmNjMTU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-08T21:31:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-08T21:31:50Z"},"message":"chore(code): install script enhancements (#4571)\n\n**deepagents-code installer (`install.sh`):**\n- Accepts a positional version: `curl -LsSf https://langch.in/dcode |\nbash -s -- 0.1.0rc1`\n- Uses a managed, rewriteable PATH block in shell profiles (`# >>>\ndeepagents-code installer >>>`)\n- Warns when an existing `dcode`/`deepagents-code` on `PATH` shadows the\nuv tool install\n- Shows actionable hints for signal kills (e.g., OOM on Linux: exit 137)\n- Serializes concurrent installs with a cross-process lock\n(`flock`/`mkdir` fallback)\n- Accepts `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_YES=true|yes|TRUE| YES ` for non-interactive\ninstalls\n- Propagates uv's real exit code on failure\n\n---\n\n### User-facing changes\n- **Positional version argument**: `curl ... | bash -s -- 0.1.0rc1` now\nworks alongside the existing `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_VERSION` env var\n- **Managed PATH block**: Shell profiles now get a delimited `# >>>\ndeepagents-code installer >>>` block that the installer owns and\nrewrites in place (instead of appending loose lines)\n- **Shadowing detection**: Warns when an older `dcode`/`deepagents-code`\nbinary earlier on `PATH` would be used instead of the newly installed uv\ntool\n- **Signal-aware failure hints**: Exit codes ≥128 now surface actionable\nmessages (e.g., exit 137 on Linux → \"ran out of memory, free up memory\nor use a larger machine\")\n- **Concurrent install safety**: A cross-process lock (`flock`\npreferred, `mkdir` fallback with stale-lock reclamation) prevents racing\n`curl | bash` runs from corrupting the shared uv tool directory\n\n### Internal hardening\n- `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_YES` now accepts truthy values (`true`, `TRUE`,\n`yes`, ` YES `)\n- Installer propagates uv's real exit code instead of flattening to `1`\n- Early up-to-date exit no longer creates a lock directory\n- macOS path avoids `lockf` (command-scoped, not fd-based)","tree":{"sha":"b2b486a21c1f17194878b4b2fd39bc79e6cf6bef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/b2b486a21c1f17194878b4b2fd39bc79e6cf6bef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/f183c1b2172c8dcbcee45ef1a6fe3ed56872cc15","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTsHGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOEYQAJ7+NPDAElOdi5CEAWHjZySI\nnt3jrrhpQZK7yQ5Ky4iajTZXm4tdkwrd/kxS5c0Z9D258m+SebxrC2jQV2AiLRV7\nm61IIu2ju00v8VZGlWZZanqQg26qNMaZ6941CH9Jc20UFWAqEHUiUViY/tg3YUmz\nQQzgb0pMomk7tx2QjSvAFoxL5eKY/Z9Qpzuv2Ig6F5uqNbEilnjhwJVqJ76yn44g\nWGCzzMioNdQRcc54i3vV8Wq1cfMIcbw2oFcfpwjc4kgVsWOSsl/F8VYKeWKetQ6Y\nXg9nihzrtUWR5BbclO3yMhk9uY82TRPVD+e6f9T+2aIJZC/KgPSmKGZNeMGCUaEb\nIMdiKYaV1yhddZO4SnAnaXobVHdEAj1JMawPx5mhDo0nAGo/JvtarpcuQzOFwJ4c\nbf9QFcj9ioQpBvqsxtEGKcIzdNUvMtz4qBn9mzptX+bRd3LEKQgCkyjmGMk7p+JK\n+yU0Wg2KWpsyNxViJpRtIINBP8oq+y8/pFKt2ehWD/1ipB0G/ny7pASi5oI+JQ8q\nN1ogY+4VC/nt2Lx/6inLR0XjY0R3GzdpXO/0hyfixm69ZwFnoCFZb0DU12vBUj2B\n5hqbDqDo1+n2GG2HXslJb60OvJFIy3ABEIFd7RoPyD6mXlOfgxPh0ZqNRH8vgKUS\nASG0q3WddC4uDjjqh10A\n=63Bt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b2b486a21c1f17194878b4b2fd39bc79e6cf6bef\nparent c9636e22725a5bd32c1f8b9e739b02b4aa7c3dc7\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783546310 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783546310 -0400\n\nchore(code): install script enhancements (#4571)\n\n**deepagents-code installer (`install.sh`):**\n- Accepts a positional version: `curl -LsSf https://langch.in/dcode |\nbash -s -- 0.1.0rc1`\n- Uses a managed, rewriteable PATH block in shell profiles (`# >>>\ndeepagents-code installer >>>`)\n- Warns when an existing `dcode`/`deepagents-code` on `PATH` shadows the\nuv tool install\n- Shows actionable hints for signal kills (e.g., OOM on Linux: exit 137)\n- Serializes concurrent installs with a cross-process lock\n(`flock`/`mkdir` fallback)\n- Accepts `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_YES=true|yes|TRUE| YES ` for non-interactive\ninstalls\n- Propagates uv's real exit code on failure\n\n---\n\n### User-facing changes\n- **Positional version argument**: `curl ... | bash -s -- 0.1.0rc1` now\nworks alongside the existing `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_VERSION` env var\n- **Managed PATH block**: Shell profiles now get a delimited `# >>>\ndeepagents-code installer >>>` block that the installer owns and\nrewrites in place (instead of appending loose lines)\n- **Shadowing detection**: Warns when an older `dcode`/`deepagents-code`\nbinary earlier on `PATH` would be used instead of the newly installed uv\ntool\n- **Signal-aware failure hints**: Exit codes ≥128 now surface actionable\nmessages (e.g., exit 137 on Linux → \"ran out of memory, free up memory\nor use a larger machine\")\n- **Concurrent install safety**: A cross-process lock (`flock`\npreferred, `mkdir` fallback with stale-lock reclamation) prevents racing\n`curl | bash` runs from corrupting the shared uv tool directory\n\n### Internal hardening\n- `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_YES` now accepts truthy values (`true`, `TRUE`,\n`yes`, ` YES `)\n- Installer propagates uv's real exit code instead of flattening to `1`\n- Early up-to-date exit no longer creates a lock directory\n- macOS path avoids `lockf` (command-scoped, not fd-based)","verified_at":"2026-07-08T21:31:51Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f183c1b2172c8dcbcee45ef1a6fe3ed56872cc15","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f183c1b2172c8dcbcee45ef1a6fe3ed56872cc15","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f183c1b2172c8dcbcee45ef1a6fe3ed56872cc15/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c9636e22725a5bd32c1f8b9e739b02b4aa7c3dc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/c9636e22725a5bd32c1f8b9e739b02b4aa7c3dc7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/c9636e22725a5bd32c1f8b9e739b02b4aa7c3dc7"}]},{"sha":"c9636e22725a5bd32c1f8b9e739b02b4aa7c3dc7","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGM5NjM2ZTIyNzI1YTViZDMyYzFmOGI5ZTczOWIwMmI0YWE3YzNkYzc","commit":{"author":{"name":"heyparth","email":"32264789+heyparth1@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-08T20:50:19Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-08T20:50:19Z"},"message":"fix(code): run stdio MCP server pre-flight check off the event loop (#4434)\n\nFixes #4433\n\n---\n\nThe stdio MCP server pre-flight check calls `shutil.which`, which makes\nblocking `os.access` calls. When run on the event loop, this triggers a\n`BlockingError` from blockbuster, preventing the agent from starting.\n\nThis wraps the `_check_stdio_server` call in `asyncio.to_thread` to\nexecute it off the event loop, resolving the blocking call issue.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dhruv <heyparth@Dhruvs-MacBook-Air.local>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"b260f06f2b7cac3429456b08de80c4e116207180","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/b260f06f2b7cac3429456b08de80c4e116207180"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/c9636e22725a5bd32c1f8b9e739b02b4aa7c3dc7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTrgLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaEcQAHd0+BX49NHP7OuCf5/hvL5m\nS+oN4tPBgSYxt21oEJ1oghxT12w4osOdSGd5NCfGPBAMfK1sqbZ5kouq9EV32R7e\nbI6MyzhweijVF2Bzlbb1izaQjuVaVhfWDsine1tznDVZfrSDdNwzWDRr8A1oiq/U\n682mO1oir96rAwIAj/6ggOVAYk+uZuDZDRJYGwMlRpreo1iqCvYZipT9mkcLWZIe\naH7qpUn8Razz08tcwh2tlP5HJWXjy4korqAsa/ONpxFfQ52nJNfGUdhSBsOflrdL\nltfFeAhplaBAh5mACLROe0ykqt3OQS+mcbbIQD/txB5MbEmdM08w8UUsbLPjw80X\nOFEGq06vtkfAqJEZAQPrsUSRme7RRCZZPboUERYPoU8KLvlaeAnVf4QxYr+Zk2qW\nfuFPVfdphLWx0xT2UIHQWdXVr8Hv259pAu8mCM3FCxgMgxvtUAKguKEOhWm7fzod\nIsygRckJ2uMAVWyodWA8OiW6wAgs0Co480vO6t4CUWhNR5UORdPA6Mb0FZgeHSUM\n95n2ZMg+Ek8WxFD0R2xiKcpKe8heN+4aDvShCSsdSR2dP5JskSdpRy4/tLGBl17W\n0yvLXuADIMMhBUs85SUKGIxnOqkafvwEfDXKYRex1pYGhN1Q67km4NinGU0yxNtI\nQ7o6x+z2DyNy2gxwpq5T\n=G1Hj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b260f06f2b7cac3429456b08de80c4e116207180\nparent b83b02bc0b8526287ebf5b6d0c18de8c0093c1bd\nauthor heyparth <32264789+heyparth1@users.noreply.github.com> 1783543819 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783543819 -0400\n\nfix(code): run stdio MCP server pre-flight check off the event loop (#4434)\n\nFixes #4433\n\n---\n\nThe stdio MCP server pre-flight check calls `shutil.which`, which makes\nblocking `os.access` calls. When run on the event loop, this triggers a\n`BlockingError` from blockbuster, preventing the agent from starting.\n\nThis wraps the `_check_stdio_server` call in `asyncio.to_thread` to\nexecute it off the event loop, resolving the blocking call issue.\n\n---------\n\nCo-