/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b83b02bc0b8526287ebf5b6d0c18de8c0093c1bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b83b02bc0b8526287ebf5b6d0c18de8c0093c1bd","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b83b02bc0b8526287ebf5b6d0c18de8c0093c1bd"}]},{"sha":"b83b02bc0b8526287ebf5b6d0c18de8c0093c1bd","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGI4M2IwMmJjMGI4NTI2Mjg3ZWJmNWI2ZDBjMThkZThjMDA5M2MxYmQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-08T20:30:25Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-08T20:30:25Z"},"message":"chore(code): simplify MCP reconnect prompt copy (#4557)\n\nThe MCP reconnect overlay body said \"Reconnect to load new tools, or\ndefer with `/mcp reconnect`.\" The defer hint is redundant with the \"Esc\nto defer\" help line right below it, so this drops that trailing clause.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/07a6957f-deda-9e24-91c7-522059a7c6b9)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"96b6b341f92109df4aed3588b648950301f98f3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/96b6b341f92109df4aed3588b648950301f98f3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/b83b02bc0b8526287ebf5b6d0c18de8c0093c1bd","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTrNhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALAwQAJfZBIEcTV2RjGSvAb+nbf/n\nA5UW2Pf96jBJH4+hZNc4pzywr+XGi93GF