","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-08T18:28:01Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-08T18:28:01Z"},"message":"ci(repo): log release dispatch inputs (#4567)\n\nAdds a non-blocking dispatch summary to the release workflow so\nmaintainers can see the source tree and release inputs directly in the\nGitHub Actions step summary.\n\nThe summary mirrors the evals workflow format and includes the resolved\npackage, optional package override, version, release SHA, and dangerous\nflags only when enabled.","tree":{"sha":"0aab57fa70938160d5c612778969ffdcda99863e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/0aab57fa70938160d5c612778969ffdcda99863e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/276144c42f06adf0606d2a1636c09cff2ff3f5f1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTpaxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIm8QAKmyd5QiK4QgcljSZPwvIN/f\nCiDldVfxuk7JJrv6BQPMSlAQL/IZLf/uQlKkus49oQ2pDymCS/iX5atluJIwXzI/\ndeu0bcS2hANeCLj6CFJsv2klVNP3WuDsvoGLF0u/2fIKRbJbONVp6BCINtNCa5kJ\ne+UL85SbNujNP9zGol4bTODruvlnIQz7Pt2tDFIogfna/g7gyoVXBiGKXeVGiwkU\ncCjWKa8lCCGlXUid1bAvoIoXa5gvKM6uxvTTGXJj+ZMGW+Z7SLux7o4ChNUCT/VG\nPj4W3A4EAw1QcTLGA3ic8Hu3eD0qAn67ScbamsbukZrfOuw4aO7rDV+hj0CjLobf\n5zhnPA+9Y9z1Qj//hgdyMBj7ThxNThDGNuZoSPdAGh+aA3P+fE4i6zT0pmO59OKK\nMSMygsUSxQZrWODqfb8EnTCovVOUcqbvkal7vsSqA25e2DN4G3OWIs20PSZRrq/P\nm2dDNwYGAjP6kg7MJG3OBaKiH/Tk0Sbtyw6qg0fB4AA7mESWEovm1KaRUJ8I52vH\nCCzFVDlFbOYsTcyMKTuXpjD5liX0QVD6sZqLD/9xtroKeIqeiBEdpsTFrTCCBkPV\nJq/u6vxxmof54rYb+b3FOdXXOi0FI1EPwB/OLg55yMSuAxWygpyqcasWeZWtJv+8\n9EpLjIrQzFI5jxYfLJmD\n=XwM+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 0aab57fa70938160d5c612778969ffdcda99863e\nparent bd9bafaad3f51d426563aa24658bbb3a089d4825\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1783535281 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783535281 -0400\n\nci(repo): log release dispatch inputs (#4567)\n\nAdds a non-blocking dispatch summary to the release workflow so\nmaintainers can see the source tree and release inputs directly in the\nGitHub Actions step summary.\n\nThe summary mirrors the evals workflow format and includes the resolved\npackage, optional package override, version, release SHA, and dangerous\nflags only when enabled.","verified_at":"2026-07-08T18:28:01Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/276144c42f06adf0606d2a1636c09cff2ff3f5f1","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/276144c42f06adf0606d2a1636c09cff2ff3f5f1","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/276144c42f06adf0606d2a1636c09cff2ff3f5f1/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followe